## The loop, in detail

1. **Classify** the intent (`SKILLS/classify-intent`): question / bug-report / feature-request / billing / other.
2. **Retrieve** from the KB (`SKILLS/retrieve-kb-answer`). If confidence ≥ threshold, answer directly.
3. **File a ticket** otherwise (`SKILLS/file-ticket`): title, description, intent, priority, links to the
   originating message. Priority follows the documented SLA matrix.
4. **Escalate** if open > SLA (`SKILLS/escalate-if-unresolved`). Hand off to a human; preserve full lineage.

